tests/unit/core_SpmStress_test.cpp has three cases and none of them is analytic. Case 1 (line 55) replays Cell_SPM:
  REQUIRE(std::abs(actual[...] - expected[...]) / scale <= 1e-12);
with `expected` taken from `cell.getDaiStress(...)` at line 68. Case 1 ends with the only non-replay assertion, an overflow probe at lines 103-109:
